<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on L'Oreal stock.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on L'Oreal stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York, Frankfurt branch has issued one million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on L'Oreal stock, lead manager Citibank S.A. said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE	  PAYDATE	19.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2115 FRF</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>	   STRIKE    ISSUE     MATURITY     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL    2100 FRF  33.25 FRF 18.SEP.98    15.01 PCT  6.4 X</p>
<p> CALL    2300 FRF  31.55 FRF 18.MAR.99    23.66 PCT  6.7 X</p>
<p> NOTES	    </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
